Cell["\<\
Now we need to rotate this to get some new perspectives on everything. If we \
just choose left or right we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll have a lot of edges \
disappear. So we need to rotate to a \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]generic\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] view. First, we try something \
that\[CloseCurlyQuote]s very close to the z-projection. \
\>", "Text",
